@startuml
title Task 3. Полный процесс экспорта данных

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor "Разработчик" as developer
participant "Docker" as docker
collections "Образы Minikube" as images
control "Kubernetes\nCronJob" as cronjob
participant "Job / Pod\nJava exporter" as exporter
database "PostgreSQL\nshipments" as database
collections "PVC\nshipment-export-data" as exportPvc
participant "output-inspector\n(проверка)" as inspector

developer -> docker : docker build
activate docker
docker -> docker : mvn --batch-mode package
docker --> developer : shipment-exporter:local
deactivate docker
developer -> images : minikube image load

note over developer, images
  **task-3/results/Dockerfile**
  1. FROM ... AS build — Maven и JDK
  2. RUN mvn ... package — создание JAR
  3. Второй FROM — компактный JRE-образ
  4. COPY --from=build — перенос app.jar
  5. ENTRYPOINT — запуск Java
end note

developer -> cronjob : kubectl apply demo-environment.yaml
developer -> cronjob : kubectl apply cronjob.yaml

note over cronjob, exporter
  **k8s/cronjob.yaml**
  spec.schedule: 0 20 * * *
  spec.timeZone: Europe/Moscow
  spec.concurrencyPolicy: Forbid
  spec.jobTemplate: настройки Job и Pod
end note

cronjob -> exporter : В 20:00 создаёт Job и Pod
activate exporter
exporter -> images : Использует shipment-exporter:local
images --> exporter : Контейнер с app.jar

note right of exporter
  **Конфигурация Pod**
  containers[].envFrom:
  • ConfigMap.data: DB_URL, DB_NAME, DB_USER,
    OUTPUT_DIR, EXPORT_TIME_ZONE,
    DB_FETCH_SIZE
  • Secret.stringData: DB_PASSWORD

  containers[].volumeMounts:
  • shipment-export-data → /data/exports
  volumes[].persistentVolumeClaim:
  • claimName: shipment-export-data
end note

exporter -> exporter : ExportSettings читает env
exporter -> exporter : Определяет текущую дату
exporter -> database : JDBC через Service shipment-db:5432\nSELECT WHERE shipment_date = текущая дата
activate database
database --> exporter : ResultSet порциями DB_FETCH_SIZE
deactivate database

note over database
  **k8s/demo-environment.yaml**
  Deployment — PostgreSQL
  Service — shipment-db:5432
  ConfigMap — настройки и init SQL
  Secret — пароль
  PersistentVolumeClaim — данные БД
end note

exporter -> exportPvc : CsvWriter записывает .csv.part
exporter -> exportPvc : Атомарно заменяет на\nshipments-YYYY-MM-DD.csv
exporter --> cronjob : exit code 0 → Job Completed
deactivate exporter

developer -> inspector : kubectl apply output-inspector.yaml
inspector -> exportPvc : Читает готовый CSV (readOnly)
exportPvc --> inspector : Список файлов и строки CSV

note over exporter, exportPvc
  Структура Java-кода показана отдельно:
  **task-3-java-class-diagram.puml**
end note

@enduml
